-
-### Quick Color Reference
-- Background: Near Black (`#121212`)
-- Surface: Dark Card (`#181818`)
-- Text: White (`#ffffff`)
-- Secondary text: Silver (`#b3b3b3`)
-- Accent: Spotify Green (`#1ed760`)
