+# RECONCILIATION DECISION RECORD — Onda 0 / Wave 1 Scope Correction
+
+**Date:** 2026-08-24
+**Baseline técnico:** `a0bb1a85`
+**Baseline documental V1:** `4ad6ddd2`
+**Baseline documental V2:** `3ebb9e33`
+**Wave 1 branch:** `wave/1-security`
+
+## 1. Estado reconciliado
